eight":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"① 标准圆角 16dp（对照基准，不落地）","textAlignHorizontal":"LEFT","textAlignVertical":"TOP"},{"id":"24:6","type":"FRAME","layout":"none","cornerRadius":32,"fills":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.9137254953384399,"g":0.9450980424880981,"b":1},"opacity":1,"visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL"}],"strokes":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.20000000298023224,"g":0.5098039507865906,"b":1},"opacity":1,"visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL"}],"width":160,"height":160,"x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"超椭圆16","clipsContent":true,"children":"..."},{"id":"24:7","type":"TEXT","fontSize":13,"lineHeight":{"unit":"AUTO"},"fontName":{"family":"Inter","style":"Medium"},"characters":"② 超椭圆 16dp · 画布参照 cornerSmoothing 0.6 / 开发实现 Modifier.squircleSurface(cornerRadius = 16.dp, extension = 1.20f)","fills":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.27450981736183167,"g":0.2823529541492462,"b":0.3019607961177826},"opacity":1,"visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL"}],"width":160,"height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"② 超椭圆 16dp · 画布参照 cornerSmoothing 0.6 / 开发实现 Modifier.squircleSurface(cornerRadius = 16.dp, extension = 1.20f)","textAlignHorizontal":"LEFT","textAlignVertical":"TOP"}]},{"id":"24:9","type":"FRAME","layout":"vertical","gap":12,"padding":{"left":0,"right":0,"top":0,"bottom":0},"width":"fill_container","height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"区2-双光源高光","clipsContent":true,"children":[{"id":"24:10","type":"FRAME","layout":"horizontal","gap":24,"padding":{"left":0,"right":0,"top":0,"bottom":0},"width":"fill_container","height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"高光演示","clipsContent":true,"children":"..."},{"id":"24:15","type":"TEXT","fontSize":13,"lineHeight":{"value":21,"unit":"PIXELS"},"fontName":{"family":"Inter","style":"Regular"},"characters":"边缘高光 — Highlight(width = 1.dp, alpha = 浅 0.10f / 深 0.16f, style = BloomStroke(innerBlurRadius = 2.dp, dualPeak = true, primaryLight = LightSource(LightPosition(0.5f, 0.35f, -0.5f), intensity = 1f), secondaryLight = LightSource(LightPosition(0.85f, 0.85f, -0.35f), intensity = 0.35f)))。库只有 width 一个描边宽（无内外各 0.5dp 之分）；LightPosition 原点在 (0.5, 0.7, 0)，负 z = 光在面后，y < 0.7 偏上。陀螺仪视差用 rememberTiltLight(sensitivity = 0.15f)，仅 Android 非零。\n坐标换算：设计稿 (0.0, -0.6, -0.08) 是中心原点、−1~1 坐标系；库是原点 (0.5, 0.7, 0)、0~1 且 shader 按 (x−0.5, y−0.7, z) 归一化。主光 x=0.0（居中）→ 库 0.5 居中 ✓；主光 y=−0.6 直加会得 0.1（贴顶越界），按 −1~1 折算取 0.35；副光 x=0.7 → 库 0.85 ✓；副光 y=0.5 却标「右下方」，而库 y<0.7 是偏上 → 必须改 0.85 才落右下，原文标注与库语义方向相反。以上 4 个坐标全部待实机确认。\n可直接抄：val isDark = MiuixTheme.colorScheme.surface.luminance() < 0.5f; Highlight(width = 1.dp, alpha = if (isDark) 0.16f else 0.10f, style = BloomStroke(innerBlurRadius = 2.dp, dualPeak = true, primaryLight = LightSource(LightPosition(0.5f, 0.35f, -0.5f), intensity = 1.0f), secondaryLight = LightSource(LightPosition(0.85f, 0.85f, -0.35f), intensity = 0.35f)))。用法：Modifier.textureBlur(backdrop, shape, highlight = highlight) —— 项目 ui/Components.kt:69 已在调 textureBlur，只补一个参数（约 6~8 行）。innerBlurRadius = 2.dp 与稿完全一致、唯一无需换算；库 6 个预设为 1.7 / 2.0 / 2.3 / 2.6 / 2.8 / 3.5 dp，2dp 恰等于 GlassStrokeMiddleDark。","fills":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.27450981736183167,"g":0.2823529541492462,"b":0.3019607961177826},"opacity":1,"visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL"}],"width":"fill_container","height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"边缘高光 — Highlight(width = 1.dp, alpha = 浅 0.10f / 深 0.16f, style = BloomStroke(innerBlurRadius = 2.dp, dualPeak = true, primaryLight = LightSource(LightPosition(0.5f, 0.35f, -0.5f), intensity = 1f), secondaryLight = LightSource(LightPosition(0.85f, 0.85f, -0.35f), intensity = 0.35f)))。库只有 width 一个描边宽（无内外各 0.5dp 之分）；LightPosition 原点在 (0.5, 0.7, 0)，负 z = 光在面后，y < 0.7 偏上。陀螺仪视差用 rememberTiltLight(sensitivity = 0.15f)，仅 Android 非零。\n坐标换算：设计稿 (0.0, -0.6, -0.08) 是中心原点、−1~1 坐标系；库是原点 (0.5, 0.7, 0)、0~1 且 shader 按 (x−0.5, y−0.7, z) 归一化。主光 x=0.0（居中）→ 库 0.5 居中 ✓；主光 y=−0.6 直加会得 0.1（贴顶越界），按 −1~1 折算取 0.35；副光 x=0.7 → 库 0.85 ✓；副光 y=0.5 却标「右下方」，而库 y<0.7 是偏上 → 必须改 0.85 才落右下，原文标注与库语义方向相反。以上 4 个坐标全部待实机确认。\n可直接抄：val isDark = MiuixTheme.colorScheme.surface.luminance() < 0.5f; Highlight(width = 1.dp, alpha = if (isDark) 0.16f else 0.10f, style = BloomStroke(innerBlurRadius = 2.dp, dualPeak = true, primaryLight = LightSource(LightPosition(0.5f, 0.35f, -0.5f), intensity = 1.0f), secondaryLight = LightSource(LightPosition(0.85f, 0.85f, -0.35f), intensity = 0.35f)))。用法：Modifier.textureBlur(backdrop, shape, highlight = highlight) —— 项目 ui/Components.kt:69 已在调 textureBlur，只补一个参数（约 6~8 行）。innerBlurRadius = 2.dp 与稿完全一致、唯一无需换算；库 6 个预设为 1.7 / 2.0 / 2.3 / 2.6 / 2.8 / 3.5 dp，2dp 恰等于 GlassStrokeMiddleDark。","textAlignHorizontal":"LEFT","textAlignVertical":"TOP"}]},{"id":"24:8","type":"TEXT","fontSize":13,"lineHeight":{"value":20,"unit":"PIXELS"},"fontName":{"family":"Inter","style":"Regular"},"characters":"结论：画布曲率取 cornerSmoothing 0.6 作视觉标准；开发侧对应 extension 取 1.20f（待实机比对 1.15 / 1.20 / 1.25 三档）。半径数值不变，全部卡片 / 按钮 / 输入框统一启用。注：Miuix 的 Card / Button / TextField / TabRow / NavigationBar 内部已使用 squircleSurface，无需逐个改；项目自绘的 21 处 Modifier.clip(RoundedCornerShape) 需换成 squircleSurface / squircleClip。","fills":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.27450981736183167,"g":0.2823529541492462,"b":0.3019607961177826},"opacity":1,"visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL"}],"width":300,"height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"结论：画布曲率取 cornerSmoothing 0.6 作视觉标准；开发侧对应 extension 取 1.20f（待实机比对 1.15 / 1.20 / 1.25 三档）。半径数值不变，全部卡片 / 按钮 / 输入框统一启用。注：Miuix 的 Card / Button / TextField / TabRow / NavigationBar 内部已使用 squircleSurface，无需逐个改；项目自绘的 21 处 Modifier.clip(RoundedCornerShape) 需换成 squircleSurface / squircleClip。","textAlignHorizontal":"LEFT","textAlignVertical":"TOP"},{"id":"24:16","type":"FRAME","layout":"vertical","gap":12,"padding":{"left":0,"right":0,"top":0,"bottom":0},"width":"fill_container","height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"区3-渐进模糊与噪点","clipsContent":true,"children":[{"id":"24:17","type":"FRAME","layout":"vertical","gap":6,"padding":{"left":16,"right":16,"top":16,"bottom":16},"cornerRadius":16,"fills":[{"type":"GRADIENT_LINEAR","visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL","opacity":1,"gradientTransform":[[0,1,0],[-1,0,1]],"gradientStops":[{"color":{"r":0.20000000298023224,"g":0.5099999904632568,"b":1,"a":0.550000011920929},"position":0,"boundVariables":{}},{"color":{"r":0.20000000298023224,"g":0.5099999904632568,"b":1,"a":0.3799999952316284},"position":0.25,"boundVariables":{}},{"color":{"r":0.20000000298023224,"g":0.5099999904632568,"b":1,"a":0.18000000715255737},"position":0.6200000047683716,"boundVariables":{}},{"color":{"r":0.20000000298023224,"g":0.5099999904632568,"b":1,"a":0},"position":1,"boundVariables":{}}]}],"width":"fill_container","height":90,"x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"渐进模糊演示","clipsContent":true,"children":"..."},{"id":"44:36","type":"TEXT","fontSize":12,"lineHeight":{"value":18,"unit":"PIXELS"},"fontName":{"family":"Inter","style":"Regular"},"characters":"渐进模糊 — Modifier.progressiveTextureBlur(backdrop, shape, blurRadius = 20f, gradient = ProgressiveBlur(angle = 90f, startFraction = 0.25f, endFraction = 1.0f, curve = 2.0f))。四个参数名与取值与库完全一致，零换算。注：库预设 ProgressiveBlur.Bottom 是 angle 270°（底部最强），本稿语义为「下方最强」→ 可直接用 angle 90f 字面值，或 ProgressiveBlur.Top.copy(startFraction = 0.25f, curve = 2.0f) 后实机比对。落地要点：顶栏高仅约 52dp，0.25→1.0 的过渡带不足 40dp，建议把该效果挂到内容区顶部独立的高 80~120dp 渐变遮罩层，不要直接压在 52dp 顶栏上。性能：每帧多一次全分辨率覆盖 pass，不要覆盖大面积。","fills":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.27450981736183167,"g":0.2823529541492462,"b":0.3019607961177826},"opacity":1,"visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL"}],"width":"fill_container","height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"渐进模糊参数（新增）","textAlignHorizontal":"LEFT","textAlignVertical":"TOP"},{"id":"24:19","type":"TEXT","fontSize":13,"lineHeight":{"value":20,"unit":"PIXELS"},"fontName":{"family":"Inter","style":"Regular"},"characters":"噪点抖动 — 两个入口（二选一）：① textureBlur(…, noiseCoefficient = 0.03f) 或 progressiveTextureBlur(…, noiseCoefficient = 0.03f)；② drawBackdrop(…, effects = { noiseDither(0.03f) })——需与 Bloom 高光 / 渐进模糊同框叠加时走这条。深色同值 0.03f。注：库默认 0.0045f（textureBlur）与 0f（progressiveTextureBlur），0.03 是默认的 6.7 倍，待实机确认是否过噪。适用范围修正：原文「所有渐变面（公告横幅、课表色块、玻璃条）」与实际不符——课表底色是纯色、公告横幅是 accent 10% 纯色，真实渐变面全稿只有 2 处（Logo、热水器主色卡）。","fills":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.27450981736183167,"g":0.2823529541492462,"b":0.3019607961177826},"opacity":1,"visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL"}],"width":"fill_container","height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"噪点 noteDither","textAlignHorizontal":"LEFT","textAlignVertical":"TOP"}]},{"id":"24:20","type":"FRAME","layout":"vertical","gap":10,"padding":{"left":0,"right":0,"top":0,"bottom":0},"width":"fill_container","height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"区4-卡片材质参数","clipsContent":true,"children":[{"id":"24:21","type":"TEXT","fontSize":13,"lineHeight":{"value":21,"unit":"PIXELS"},"fontName":{"family":"Inter","style":"Regular"},"characters":"卡片材质 — Miuix Card 无 elevation / border 参数（CardColors 只有 color + contentColor），投影与描边必须外层补：投影 Modifier.shadow(elevation = 浅 1.dp / 深 2.dp, shape = RoundedCornerShape(16.dp), ambientColor = spotColor = rgba(40,50,70,0.06) / rgba(0,0,0,0.35))；描边 Modifier.squircleBorder(width = 1.dp, color = 浅 #EEF0F4 / 深 #262A31, cornerRadius = 16.dp)（INSIDE 语义由库自动内缩半宽实现）。内阴影：普通 / 可点卡片不用；仅输入框禁用态在 Modifier.drawBehind 里手绘 inset。按下态：pressFeedbackType = PressFeedbackType.Sink 提供缩放；面叠加色需自己 interactionSource + animateColorAsState 喂给 CardColors.color；投影回收用 animateDpAsState。约束：Modifier.shadow 只吃 Compose Shape（用 RoundedCornerShape），squircleBorder 是 MIUIX 的 path 实现 —— 两者是两套 shape，视觉对齐靠 extension 微调。","fills":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.27450981736183167,"g":0.2823529541492462,"b":0.3019607961177826},"opacity":1,"visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL"}],"width":"fill_container","height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"卡片材质 — Miuix Card 无 elevation / border 参数（CardColors 只有 color + contentColor），投影与描边必须外层补：投影 Modifier.shadow(elevation = 浅 1.dp / 深 2.dp, shape = RoundedCornerShape(16.dp), ambientColor = spotColor = rgba(40,50,70,0.06) / rgba(0,0,0,0.35))；描边 Modifier.squircleBorder(width = 1.dp, color = 浅 #EEF0F4 / 深 #262A31, cornerRadius = 16.dp)（INSIDE 语义由库自动内缩半宽实现）。内阴影：普通 / 可点卡片不用；仅输入框禁用态在 Modifier.drawBehind 里手绘 inset。按下态：pressFeedbackType = PressFeedbackType.Sink 提供缩放；面叠加色需自己 interactionSource + animateColorAsState 喂给 CardColors.color；投影回收用 animateDpAsState。约束：Modifier.shadow 只吃 Compose Shape（用 RoundedCornerShape），squircleBorder 是 MIUIX 的 path 实现 —— 两者是两套 shape，视觉对齐靠 extension 微调。","textAlignHorizontal":"LEFT","textAlignVertical":"TOP"},{"id":"36:97","type":"TEXT","fontSize":12,"lineHeight":{"unit":"AUTO"},"fontName":{"family":"Sarasa Gothic SC","style":"Regular"},"characters":"深色卡片对比度规则：卡片 #1A1C21 对页面底 #0D0F12 实测仅 1.13:1，会让卡片读成「洞」而不是「浮起的面」。规范要求深色卡片与页面底 ≥ 1.25:1。两条可选落地：① 卡片升到 #22262D（1.26:1，App 现用值）；② 页面底压到 #0A0C0F（1.22:1）。浅色侧 #FFFFFF on #F2F2F5 同为 1.13:1，但卡片更亮，视觉正确，无需调整。","fills":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.27450981736183167,"g":0.2823529541492462,"b":0.3019607961177826},"opacity":1,"visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL"}],"width":"fill_container","height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"深色卡片对比度规则（新增）","textAlignHorizontal":"LEFT","textAlignVertical":"TOP"}]},{"id":"24:473","type":"FRAME","layout":"vertical","gap":6,"padding":{"left":16,"right":16,"top":16,"bottom":16},"cornerRadius":16,"fills":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.9607843160629272,"g":0.9686274528503418,"b":0.9803921580314636},"opacity":1,"visible":true,"blendMode":"NORMAL"}],"width":"fill_container","height":"hug_contents","x":"auto","y":"auto","name":"P2 批量套用说明","clipsContent":true,"children":[{"id":"24:474","type":"TEXT","fontSize":12,"lineHeight":{"value":18,"unit":"PIXELS"},"fontName":{"family":"Inter","style":"SemiBold"},"characters":"P2 批量套用（场馆预约、体测报名、校园跑、成绩与轨迹、文章列表/详情、公告、浏览历史、意见反馈、应用更新、关于、开发者选项、热水器、校园网）—— 全部沿用现有版式，仅统一以下材质，不动任何尺寸与色值。落地口径：4 项材质改动集中在 2 个文件（ui/Components.kt 的 Screen() 统一入口 + App.kt 底栏），其余页面自动继承：","fills":[{"type":"SOLID","color":{"r":0.27450981736183167,"g":0.2823529541